<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?><?xml-stylesheet href="http://www.blogger.com/styles/atom.css" type="text/css"?><feed xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom' xmlns:openSearch='http://a9.com/-/spec/opensearchrss/1.0/' xmlns:gd="http://schemas.google.com/g/2005"><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post4435969426771826836..comments</id><updated>2017-04-13T04:47:21.148-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Comments on Pro Libertate: Put Not Your Trust In Federalized Sheriffs </title><link rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#feed' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/feeds/comments/default'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4435969426771826836/comments/default'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/01/put-not-your-trust-in-federalized.html'/><link rel="hub" href="http://pubsubhubbub.appspot.com/"/><link rel='next' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4435969426771826836/comments/default?start-index=26&amp;max-results=25'/><author><name>William N. Grigg</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/14368220509514750246</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='19' src='http://3.bp.blogspot.com/-5rhFUXs_62I/VgVL2E3rMII/AAAAAAAAMJ4/cjJOyI7W208/s220/Photo%2BRon%2BPaul%2BLiberty%2BReport.jpg'/></author><generator version='7.00' uri='http://www.blogger.com'>Blogger</generator><openSearch:totalResults>33</openSearch:totalResults><openSearch:startIndex>1</openSearch:startIndex><openSearch:itemsPerPage>25</openSearch:itemsPerPage><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5385473306485411340</id><published>2013-02-05T09:46:57.783-07:00</published><updated>2013-02-05T09:46:57.783-07:00</updated><title type='text'>All police officers are agents of state-authorized...</title><content type='html'>All police officers are agents of state-authorized violence. They are indoctrinated to treat all citizens as a threat to &amp;quot;Officer Safety,&amp;quot; which they are taught to perceive as the most important consideration in all interactions with the public. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;It doesn&amp;#39;t matter whether they are &amp;quot;good&amp;quot; or &amp;quot;bad&amp;quot;; the point is that each of them is a threat and should be perceived as such. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;On the subject of over-broad characterizations, it should be pointed out that neither of the examples you cite helps your case. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Adam Lanza was not a gun owner; he stole firearms that belonged to his mother. Nor is there so much as a particle of evidence that Ted Kaczynski, whose preferred weapon was an improvised bomb, was an advocate of the Second Amendment. These may seem like tiny nits at which to pick, but let the record reflect that you&amp;#39;re the one accusing other people of trafficking in lazy stereotypes.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4435969426771826836/comments/default/5385473306485411340'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4435969426771826836/comments/default/5385473306485411340'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/01/put-not-your-trust-in-federalized.html?showComment=1360082817783#c5385473306485411340' title=''/><author><name>William N. Grigg</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/14368220509514750246</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='29' src='http://1.bp.blogspot.com/-4MVb4nTxouY/UJ0ryiFr79I/AAAAAAAAIWk/c5YUCAg8xUA/s220/ProfilePic.png'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/01/put-not-your-trust-in-federalized.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4435969426771826836' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4435969426771826836' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1344012943"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="February 5, 2013 at 9:46 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6671994954064886665</id><published>2013-02-05T09:15:28.447-07:00</published><updated>2013-02-05T09:15:28.447-07:00</updated><title type='text'>I do find it offensive that your general assumptio...</title><content type='html'>I do find it offensive that your general assumption is that all officers and deputies are like the nimrod in the video and should be regarded as so. To say that is to say all gun owners are like the kid in Conn. or that all pro-Second people are like the Unabomber. Sorry but trying to paint all officer/deputies as bad because of the actions of others is juvenile and hurts your claims.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4435969426771826836/comments/default/6671994954064886665'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4435969426771826836/comments/default/6671994954064886665'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/01/put-not-your-trust-in-federalized.html?showComment=1360080928447#c6671994954064886665' title=''/><author><name>Da Man</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/00483917923934280007</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/01/put-not-your-trust-in-federalized.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4435969426771826836' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4435969426771826836' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-415157415"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="February 5, 2013 at 9:15 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4479297781090280565</id><published>2013-02-05T09:01:32.690-07:00</published><updated>2013-02-05T09:01:32.690-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Couple of things I have noticed from the comments....</title><content type='html'>Couple of things I have noticed from the comments. It really does not matter if a Sheriff makes a statement, because many on here think they are all going to be gun-grabbers in the end. Another, somehow taking grant money makes them part of the problem, even if it is money for school security. Sorry, but who is that? You mean I cant stand for the Second and not take tax money being returned to the local area. If some of you think that no one in your local county should take federal tax money then all of your cities and county governments would be broke in weeks. I understand some on here are very anti-government to the point that you just distrust everyone, but lets not be over the top. As for tying drugs to the right to bear arms...thats a hard battle to try and win. Sorry but most people that support the 2nd are not going to also their sheriffs to not enforce drug laws. One is in the constitution and the other is not. In the end, if it came down to it, the military and law enforcement will both have people split on the issue just as the publc is. The lines will be drawn and some will be willing to cross over to fight for thir rights. But in the end, taking grant money back from the government for services to provide does not mean you wont draw the line when it comes to gun laws.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4435969426771826836/comments/default/4479297781090280565'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4435969426771826836/comments/default/4479297781090280565'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/01/put-not-your-trust-in-federalized.html?showComment=1360080092690#c4479297781090280565' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/01/put-not-your-trust-in-federalized.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4435969426771826836' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4435969426771826836' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-83258226"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="February 5, 2013 at 9:01 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-269501280819893517</id><published>2013-01-29T17:11:19.705-07:00</published><updated>2013-01-29T17:11:19.705-07:00</updated><title type='text'>What it boils down to is us against them. If you t...</title><content type='html'>What it boils down to is us against them. If you think for one minute that police will be on your side just keep those blinders on..</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4435969426771826836/comments/default/269501280819893517'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4435969426771826836/comments/default/269501280819893517'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/01/put-not-your-trust-in-federalized.html?showComment=1359504679705#c269501280819893517' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/01/put-not-your-trust-in-federalized.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4435969426771826836' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4435969426771826836' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1247131716"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="January 29, 2013 at 5:11 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-777409900472847322</id><published>2013-01-28T14:08:30.539-07:00</published><updated>2013-01-28T14:08:30.539-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Mr. Lava -- I do read through the comments, and I ...</title><content type='html'>Mr. Lava -- I do read through the comments, and I received your e-mail regarding surveillance. Thank you!</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4435969426771826836/comments/default/777409900472847322'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4435969426771826836/comments/default/777409900472847322'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/01/put-not-your-trust-in-federalized.html?showComment=1359407310539#c777409900472847322' title=''/><author><name>William N. Grigg</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/14368220509514750246</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='29' src='http://1.bp.blogspot.com/-4MVb4nTxouY/UJ0ryiFr79I/AAAAAAAAIWk/c5YUCAg8xUA/s220/ProfilePic.png'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/01/put-not-your-trust-in-federalized.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4435969426771826836' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4435969426771826836' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1344012943"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="January 28, 2013 at 2:08 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-36229851718882897</id><published>2013-01-28T11:39:27.733-07:00</published><updated>2013-01-28T11:39:27.733-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Some of my favorite bloggers turn out to be those ...</title><content type='html'>Some of my favorite bloggers turn out to be those apologists, too.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Grits for Breakfast writes a good, if jargonesque, blog about the legal system. (I forget his real name)  I was surprised when he said exactly what Adrian Garcia said about guns in classrooms.  &lt;br /&gt;His take is that the children are so dumb they&amp;#39;ll play around with it and get shot.   &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;~~&lt;br /&gt;Lava&lt;br /&gt;~~&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Grigg, I didn&amp;#39;t think you would read thru comments and I wanted to suggest two items on surveillance and/or ticket cameras.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4435969426771826836/comments/default/36229851718882897'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4435969426771826836/comments/default/36229851718882897'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/01/put-not-your-trust-in-federalized.html?showComment=1359398367733#c36229851718882897' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/01/put-not-your-trust-in-federalized.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4435969426771826836' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4435969426771826836' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-302966393"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="January 28, 2013 at 11:39 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6556367989030983091</id><published>2013-01-28T05:25:53.292-07:00</published><updated>2013-01-28T05:25:53.292-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Joshua, by that reasoning if a drone hovers right ...</title><content type='html'>Joshua, by that reasoning if a drone hovers right outside your window, or along the property line, and zooms in without &amp;quot;touching&amp;quot; the surface of the ground, and they &amp;quot;suspect&amp;quot; you of ANYTHING (and when hasn&amp;#39;t a cop not abused any tools they acquire) then they&amp;#39;ll use that surveillance as yet another excuse to kick in your door.  I&amp;#39;m sick and tired of all the tortured legal gymnastics used against the citizenry to bludgeon us, once again, with the constant drumbeat of totalitarian diktats.  Reasonable?  Reasonable to WHOM? Who else but Leviathan and it&amp;#39;s goose-stepping minions and lick spittle apologists.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4435969426771826836/comments/default/6556367989030983091'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4435969426771826836/comments/default/6556367989030983091'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/01/put-not-your-trust-in-federalized.html?showComment=1359375953292#c6556367989030983091' title=''/><author><name>MoT</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/01/put-not-your-trust-in-federalized.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4435969426771826836' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4435969426771826836' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-21533853"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="January 28, 2013 at 5:25 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6660686577848772928</id><published>2013-01-27T08:34:31.383-07:00</published><updated>2013-01-27T08:34:31.383-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Good article overall, but one point you make used ...</title><content type='html'>Good article overall, but one point you make used the rhetorical figure of an astute journalist asking about overhead surveillance being unconstitutional: It is not unconstitutional to make optical contact with a surface. Search and seizure case law is pretty established on this point, since Knotts and recently reiterated under Jones. The English doctrine of &amp;quot;The eye, by the laws of England, cannot be guilty of a trespass,&amp;quot; is the primary doctrine that infuses this side of search law: we don&amp;#39;t outlaw a cop&amp;#39;s visual contact with a surface any more than we do of a citizen&amp;#39;s. So aerial overflights are okay, under our interpretations of the Fourth Amendment, if it is reasonable to expect overhead flights because overhead flights of a commercial nature already exist, under Florida v. Riley. (or at least, so goes the interpretation of &amp;quot;reasonable expectation of privacy,&amp;quot; contextualized for the new technologies).</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4435969426771826836/comments/default/6660686577848772928'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4435969426771826836/comments/default/6660686577848772928'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/01/put-not-your-trust-in-federalized.html?showComment=1359300871383#c6660686577848772928' title=''/><author><name>Joshua Cottle</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/14142752222806140466</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='32' src='http://2.bp.blogspot.com/-k0hB8zidR18/UBxJuxLs6HI/AAAAAAAAABg/p3RACfRBPOQ/s1600/285d68a.jpg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/01/put-not-your-trust-in-federalized.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4435969426771826836' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4435969426771826836' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-83247277"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="January 27, 2013 at 8:34 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6986707213778210376</id><published>2013-01-27T02:48:37.960-07:00</published><updated>2013-01-27T02:48:37.960-07:00</updated><title type='text'>oink&#xa;&#xa;oinkety oinkety oink</title><content type='html'>oink&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;oinkety oinkety oink</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4435969426771826836/comments/default/6986707213778210376'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4435969426771826836/comments/default/6986707213778210376'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/01/put-not-your-trust-in-federalized.html?showComment=1359280117960#c6986707213778210376' title=''/><author><name>ray</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/11380746207592226835</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/01/put-not-your-trust-in-federalized.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4435969426771826836' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4435969426771826836' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-2087141373"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="January 27, 2013 at 2:48 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8963720569086593606</id><published>2013-01-26T14:56:36.495-07:00</published><updated>2013-01-26T14:56:36.495-07:00</updated><title type='text'>&amp;quot;Sheriff Mims heroically subdues a violent pl...</title><content type='html'>&amp;quot;Sheriff Mims heroically subdues a violent plant.&amp;quot;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;oh man, that was funny!!!&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;frenchy</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4435969426771826836/comments/default/8963720569086593606'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4435969426771826836/comments/default/8963720569086593606'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/01/put-not-your-trust-in-federalized.html?showComment=1359237396495#c8963720569086593606' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/01/put-not-your-trust-in-federalized.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4435969426771826836' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4435969426771826836' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1385841849"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="January 26, 2013 at 2:56 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-570680911144271525</id><published>2013-01-26T10:29:18.635-07:00</published><updated>2013-01-26T10:29:18.635-07:00</updated><title type='text'>So these poseur sheriffs are just putting on a sho...</title><content type='html'>So these poseur sheriffs are just putting on a show? That is ok appearance is everything. Beyonce the magnificent was actually singing the other day at the immaculation of Imam Hussein and he loves this country. They could just get some blue helmets or Won Dum Sumbitch down at the Chinee free trade zone to do the confiscation comrades. This is the great leap forward that low information voters wanted so I hope it all works out for them. We wouldn&amp;#39;t want to disturb their delusions or comfort.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4435969426771826836/comments/default/570680911144271525'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4435969426771826836/comments/default/570680911144271525'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/01/put-not-your-trust-in-federalized.html?showComment=1359221358635#c570680911144271525' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/01/put-not-your-trust-in-federalized.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4435969426771826836' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4435969426771826836' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-2127844123"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="January 26, 2013 at 10:29 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3185341946150082646</id><published>2013-01-25T16:21:07.085-07:00</published><updated>2013-01-25T16:21:07.085-07:00</updated><title type='text'>I live in Houston, TX and just saw a perfect examp...</title><content type='html'>I live in Houston, TX and just saw a perfect example of this.  Harris County Sheriff, Adrian Garcia, hasn&amp;#39;t made any statements on protecting gun rights for the public, but he just stated that armed teachers in the classroom are a &amp;quot;bad idea.&amp;quot;  He claims that his deputies would have a hard time distinguishing between a malicious shooter and an armed teacher.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;http://www.chron.com/news/houston-texas/houston/article/At-school-safety-meeting-panelists-focus-on-4222224.php&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;By the time the deputies get there, it will be over and the teacher would have set the gun down, so it would really be no problem.  Our Sheriff would rather more kids die while waiting for the cops than see his deputies have a hard time.  He obviously doesn&amp;#39;t care about us or our children.  Glad I didn&amp;#39;t vote for him.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4435969426771826836/comments/default/3185341946150082646'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4435969426771826836/comments/default/3185341946150082646'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/01/put-not-your-trust-in-federalized.html?showComment=1359156067085#c3185341946150082646' title=''/><author><name>Dan Clem</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndica